---
title: Welcome to my blog
---

mixin question(q)
  div.card.my-3(style="width: 24rem;")
    div.card-header: strong #[i.fa-solid.fa-message] #{q}
    div.card-body
      block

p If you don't know me, hi! I'm DarkblooM. I'm a 23 year old computer science student from France.

p My main points of interest are:
ul
  li computer science
  li gaming
  li music
  li motorcycles

p I decided to create this blog talk about various stuff that I find interesting or funny. Maybe write some guides here and there.

h2 Q&A

+question("Why not use an existing platform?"): p.card-text.
  I just thought it'd be neat to have my own, that way I can make it look just how I want and I can add whatever I want to it.

+question("Are you on social media?")
  p.card-text Yes!
  a.card-link(href="https://bsky.app/profile/darkblo0m.bsky.social" target="_blank"): i.fab.fa-bluesky
  a.card-link(href="https://threads.com/@darkbloom.io" target="_blank"): i.fab.fa-threads
  a.card-link(href="https://youtube.com/@darkbloom_io" target="_blank"): i.fab.fa-youtube
  a.card-link(href="https://reddit.com/u/darkbloom_sr" target="_blank"): i.fab.fa-reddit

+question("How did you build this website?"): p.card-text.
  I use #[a(href="#" target="_blank") Build Awesome] (formerly 11ty) to generate the whole site statically, as well as #[a(href="#" target="_blank") Bootstrap] for UI and #[a(href="#" target="_blank") Font Awesome] for icons.
